::ENG4_U06_L04_Q01::[MLA.ENG4.C.02] Scenario: A student team has copied paragraphs, unrelated photos, an unlabeled chart, and no clear speaker-note plan for explaining evidence about career certification access. Which option best improves digital presentation effectiveness? {
=A. Replace copied paragraphs with concise bullets and speaker notes that explain the evidence.#Correct. This answer best applies the lesson skill with clear reasoning, appropriate evidence, and audience awareness.
~B. Add unrelated photos so the deck looks more active.#Incorrect. Review the lesson explanation and choose the option that best connects purpose, evidence, design, and audience.
~C. Keep source paragraphs on slides so the audience can read everything.#Incorrect. Review the lesson explanation and choose the option that best connects purpose, evidence, design, and audience.
~D. Use smaller font to fit more information onto each slide.#Incorrect. Review the lesson explanation and choose the option that best connects purpose, evidence, design, and audience.
}

